tei:div.tei:p:
//bla ma dam pa rnams la phyag 'tshal lo//
dang por sems bskyed/ rang skad cig gis lha mor mos/ snying gar hrīḥdamar po zla ba gnas par bsgom/ 'od zer gyis bla ma dang ku ru kul+les gtso byas pa'i sangs rgyas dang byang chub sems dpa' spyan drangs mdun gyi nam mkhar bzhugs pa la mchod pa lngas mchod/ gur gyi tshigs bcad gnyis brjod cing skyabs su 'gro ba dang sems bskyed bya/ de nas tshad med pa bzhi bsgom/ bsod nams dang ye shes kyi tshogs shū n+ya tās stong par bsgom/ de nas pad zla'i steng du hrīḥdamar po las 'od 'phros bsdus hrīḥl thim pa las lha mor rang bskyed/ sku mdog dmar po zhal gcig phyag bzhi ma/ g.yas g.yon dang po mda' gzhu 'gengs pa/ g.yas kyi gnyis pa na lcags kyu 'dzin pa/ g.yon gnyis pa na ut+pal dmar po bsnams pa/ zhabs g.yas cung zad brkyang ba/ g.yon bskum pa'i phyed krung pad+ma dmar po dang zla ba'am nyi ma la bzhugs par bsgom/ rang gi snying gar zla ba dang nyi ma gang rung gi kha ru hrīḥbasgom/ 'od kyis rang dang 'dra ba'i ye shes sems dpa' spyan drangs/ dzaḥhūm̐ baṃ hoḥs rang la bstim/ rigs lngas dbang bskur/ 'od dpag med kyis dbur brgyan par bsam/ snying gar hrīḥlas sngags g.yas su bskor ba la bzlas pa bya/ de rang dang snying ga'i sngags sa bon dang bcas pa las 'od dmar po 'phros te/ dbang du bya ba'i bsgrub bya bkug ste mdun na gnas pa la phog pas dmar lam byung bar gyur cing dbang du 'dus par bsam/ bsnyen sngags 'bum phrag bdun/ las dus khri phrag gnyis so//
oṃ a sha grwa ta gha ra/ ma hā bi dha ni ban+dha urta ban+ta/ badz+ra has+tha badz+ra muṣ+ṭi/ badz+ra di wi san tuṣ+ṭi/ badz+ra aṃ gu ri/ ma yi si wu ta/ san duṣ+ṭi/ e ka wu ga wo/ na phu tra hi mo ri triṣ+ṭhi/ oṃ baṃ ki dha li/ muñtsa sin+dha/ tam+bha yi sha li/ kan+ta yi sha li/ ma yi rwa su ta/ pha la yi na su ta/ dzha bha/ sung pa was/
